 <a id="use-this-package"></a>
 ## Use this package
 
+`delete(id)` acquires exclusive write ownership and the Session lease, removes that Session directory and its stored format generations, and invalidates cached log discovery. Active writers prevent deletion; an absent Session returns false. The configured root and neighboring directories are retained.
+
 Mount this backend when a composition needs durable sessions backed by per-session files. The common path is explicit: load the session service, mount the backend, and give it a root directory.
 
 ### When to choose it
