 <a id="use-this-package"></a>
 ## Use this package
 
+`delete(id)` permanently removes one stored Session after its writer has closed. Backends that do not implement deletion reject it explicitly. Callers own confirmation, Agent shutdown, and workspace membership cleanup.
+
 Mount one persistence backend to make sessions durable. The backend registers itself as `ctx.sessionPersistence` and routes every published session's live events into that session's active write handle; agent-loop — the production publication point for sessions — acquires each session's write handle before publication, so nothing else in the composition changes.
 
 ### Choosing a backend
diff --git a/packages/session/session-persistence/README.zh.md b/packages/session/session-persistence/README.zh.md
index ae8547aa4e..ee48fe1f41 100644
--- a/packages/session/session-persistence/README.zh.md
+++ b/packages/session/session-persistence/README.zh.md
@@ -25,6 +25,8 @@ kind: "package-reference"
 <a id="use-this-package"></a>
 ## 使用本包
 
+`delete(id)` 在写入者关闭后永久删除一个已保存的对话。未实现删除的后端会显式拒绝操作。调用方负责确认、停止 Agent 和清理工作区成员关系。
+
 挂载一个持久化后端即可让会话持久化。后端把自己注册为 `ctx.sessionPersistence`，并把每个已发布会话的实时事件路由进该会话的活跃写句柄；agent-loop——会话在生产环境中的发布点——在发布之前获取每个会话的写句柄，因此组合中的其他部分不变。
 
 ### 选择后端
diff --git a/packages/session/session-persistence/src/index.ts b/packages/session/session-persistence/src/index.ts
index f257ca0e1e..8628820e2f 100644
--- a/packages/session/session-persistence/src/index.ts
+++ b/packages/session/session-persistence/src/index.ts
@@ -201,6 +201,17 @@ export abstract class SessionPersistence extends Service {
    * @returns one snapshot per stored session.
    */
   abstract list(options?: SessionPersistenceListOptions): Promise<readonly SessionPersistenceSnapshot[]>
+
+  /**
+   * Permanently delete an entire stored Session, including every historical generation.
+   * Active write ownership must be released before calling this operation.
+   * @param id - Session explicitly selected for deletion.
+   * @returns Whether a stored Session existed.
+   * @throws When the provider does not support deletion or a writer still owns the Session.
+   */
+  delete(id: SessionId): Promise<boolean> {
+    return Promise.reject(new Error(`Session deletion is not supported by ${this.constructor.name}: ${id}`))
+  }
 }
 
 export default SessionPersistence
